   urban teenagers for whom shopping malls are places where they like to
   spend their leisure time without parental supervision and provide them
   with a place to socialise and meet friends in the first place. Shopping
   in shopping malls is often irrelevant to them. Their primary interest is
   socialising with friends, it is important to ,,flex{''} for many of them
   or they are considered to be ,,hypebeasts{''}.},
